THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

None. Every asset in this repository was made for it:

  - The twenty-four sound files are generated, not sampled. Each melody is a
    table in a Python script in tools/, so the source of every note is in the
    repository and nothing was taken from a recording.
  - The icons and interface artwork are drawn as SVG in this repository.
  - No font file ships with this software. The stylesheet names a stack of
    fonts already present on the host and falls through to a generic family.

The interface takes visual cues from the design conventions of modern mobile
operating systems: rounded rectangles, translucent bars, a grid of icons.
